    <item>
      <title>Linkle Icons - Fixed &amp; Expanded</title>
      <author>VenomAhab</author>
      <link>https://gamebanana.com/mods/739794</link>
      <comments>https://gamebanana.com/mods/739794#PostsListModule</comments>
      <guid isPermaLink="false">1874a939e1a19e6c8af21259f8168247fb19f145</guid>
      <pubDate>Fri, 13 Nov 2026 00:27:59 +0000</pubDate>
      <description>&lt;img src="https://images.gamebanana.com/img/ss/mods/6af6a952c1c41.jpg"/&gt;&lt;img src="https://images.gamebanana.com/img/ss/mods/6af7fae64e426.jpg"/&gt;&lt;img src="https://images.gamebanana.com/img/ss/mods/6af8095272dae.jpg"/&gt;&lt;br&gt;The Problem with the Original Mod:&lt;br&gt;If you tried the original mod, you probably noticed that most of the armor icons were completely invisible or transparent. This happened because the original BNTX texture files were saved incorrectly. They were exported as uncompressed RGBA8, 288x288 resolution, and with a linear tile mode. Tears of the Kingdom (and especially the PC Recompilation) strictly expects 256x256 ASTC_4x4 SRGB textures with a block-linear (swizzled) layout. Because of this mismatch, the game's UI simply couldn't read the files.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;What I Did:&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;ul&gt;&lt;li&gt;Reconverted all 3,700+ icons: Every texture has been decompressed, resized to 256x256, re-encoded to ASTC 4x4, and properly swizzled. They now perfectly match vanilla file sizes, formats, and headers, so they load flawlessly without breaking the RSTB or causing memory issues.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;Added missing icons: Many TotK-exclusive armor pieces didn't have Linkle icons in the original port. I've manually captured and added icons for these missing sets so they match the rest of the UI.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;Ongoing updates: There are still a few rare armor variants left to capture, but they will be added in future updates.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;Second Quest Compatibility:&lt;br&gt;The original &lt;em&gt;Second Quest&lt;/em&gt; mod introduces new upgrade levels for armors (e.g., Level 2, 3, 4) that don't exist in the vanilla game. I have included a separate patch file for Second Quest. It ensures that all these new armor tiers automatically inherit the correct Linkle icons, so you don't get vanilla Link's face popping up when you upgrade your gear.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;Installation Notes:&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;ul&gt;&lt;li&gt;Make sure to disable/delete the original &lt;em&gt;Linkle Icons 3.0&lt;/em&gt; mod to avoid file conflicts.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;Place this mod (and the Second Quest patch, if you use it) above the Linkle Mod (And Second Quest mod) in your load order (TKMM or Recomp Mod menu).&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;Tested primarily on the PC Recompilation (v1.4.3), but should work on emulators as well.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;Note on AI usage: The Python scripts used for converting, resizing, and patching the BNTX icons in this mod were developed with the assistance of Claude (Anthropic) AI. All the artistic work (the icons themselves) and the final technical testing was done manually.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;Credits:&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;ul&gt;&lt;li&gt;Original &lt;em&gt;Linkle 3.0 Icons&lt;/em&gt; mod by the original creator.&lt;br&gt;&lt;a href="https://gamebanana.com/mods/647007"&gt;Linkle 3.0 Icons Mod for The Legend of Zelda: Tears of the Kingdom | TOTK Mods&lt;/a&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;em&gt;Linkle&lt;/em&gt; model and textures by the respective modding teams.&lt;br&gt;&lt;a href="https://gamebanana.com/wips/80967"&gt;The Linkle Mod [DOWNLOAD] Work In Progress for The Legend of Zelda: Tears of the Kingdom | TOTK Works In Progress&lt;/a&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;• "Tool" mod used by  &lt;a class="MemberLink" href="https://gamebanana.com/members/1782454" data-id="member_1782454"&gt;&lt;img loading="lazy" src="https://images.gamebanana.com/img/upic/655f91f00a522.png" alt="Aster uPic" class="Upic"&gt;&lt;indicator class="Online"&gt;&lt;/indicator&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;a href="https://gamebanana.com/members/submissions/contributions/1782454" class="CreditsLink" aria-label="Contributions"&gt;&lt;spriteicon class="SubnavigatorIcon ContributionsIcon"&gt;&lt;/spriteicon&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;a href="https://gamebanana.com/mods/473451"&gt;Armor Icon Helper Tool Mod for The Legend of Zelda: Tears of the Kingdom | TOTK Mods&lt;/a&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;dt class="AuthorsGroup"&gt;•Ai Claude (Anthropic)&lt;/dt&gt;&lt;dd class="AuthorsGroup"&gt;&lt;dl&gt;&lt;dd class="Author"&gt;AI Assistant for Python script development&lt;/dd&gt;&lt;/dl&gt;&lt;/dd&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;</description>
      <media:content url="https://files.gamebanana.com/mods/linkle_icons_-_fixed_expanded_v1_1.zip" type="application/zip"/>
      <media:content url="https://files.gamebanana.com/mods/second_quest_patch_v1_1.zip" type="application/zip"/>
      <media:content url="https://files.gamebanana.com/mods/linkle_icons_-_fixed_expanded.zip" type="application/zip"/>
