    <item>
      <title>Zonai Survey</title>
      <author>HanSoloBlaster</author>
      <link>https://gamebanana.com/mods/713365</link>
      <comments>https://gamebanana.com/mods/713365#PostsListModule</comments>
      <guid isPermaLink="false">e00ee915cc558bc416878437604be7555f372fe6</guid>
      <pubDate>Wed, 11 Nov 2026 15:46:38 +0000</pubDate>
      <description>&lt;img src="https://images.gamebanana.com/img/ss/mods/6aa6fc116b049.jpg"/&gt;&lt;img src="https://images.gamebanana.com/img/ss/mods/6aa70f617b8a7.jpg"/&gt;&lt;img src="https://images.gamebanana.com/img/ss/mods/6aa70f60a516d.jpg"/&gt;&lt;img src="https://images.gamebanana.com/img/ss/mods/6aa7096d9e8bb.jpg"/&gt;&lt;img src="https://images.gamebanana.com/img/ss/mods/6aa6fc825c97f.jpg"/&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Update:&lt;/strong&gt; Fieldworks, Support Multiple Languages&lt;br&gt;&lt;h3&gt;v0.4.2&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;ul&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;p&gt;Added to &lt;a target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer nofollow" href="https://gamebanana.com/mods/739060"&gt;Zonai Fieldworks&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;p&gt;Fixed an issue where the scan did nothing with Ultimate Ascend installed.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;p&gt;Still not compatible with Ultimate Ascend and Self Recall installed at the same time (Survey stays off).&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;h3&gt;v0.4.0&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;ul&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;p&gt;Collectible labels now use your game's text language.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;h3&gt;v0.3.0&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;ul&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;p&gt;Text and glyphs on labels are now much sharper and clearer.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;p&gt;Labels now fade rather than flicker when being removed.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;h3&gt;v0.2.0&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;ul&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;p&gt;Now supports every version of Tears of the Kingdom on Switch and emulator: v1.0.0 - v1.4.3&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;hr&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;h1&gt;Zonai Survey&lt;/h1&gt;&lt;h2&gt;Description&lt;/h2&gt;Pressing &lt;b&gt;ZL + D-pad Up&lt;/b&gt; starts a Death-Stranding-inspired scan/survey that labels items in front of you by ~440m. Constrained releases introduce a 180 m survey distance cap and a cooldown lasting 7 seconds. &lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;For installation instructions and more please refer to the &lt;a href="//github.com/afiaka87/zonai-survey"&gt;README&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;h2&gt;Limitations&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;ul&gt;&lt;li&gt;Supports TotK 1.0.0, 1.1.0, 1.1.2, 1.2.0, 1.2.1 and 1.4.0-1.4.3.&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;May conflict/break when other exeFS mods are enabled.&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;On Switch hardware, you may notice a slight 3-5 fps dip when running the scan specifically over grass-dense areas.&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;h2&gt;Source and license&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;del&gt;Zonai Survey is GPL-2.0-only. The text renderer and part of the overlay hook are derived from &lt;a href="https://github.com/aquacluck/totk-lotuskit" target="_blank"&gt;totk-lotuskit&lt;/a&gt; by aquacluck and its contributors.&lt;/del&gt; &lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;Zonai Survey is now MIT licensed after replacing the lotuskit text renderer with a custom shader-based method. See &lt;a href="//NOTICE"&gt;NOTICE&lt;/a&gt; for full attribution.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;h2&gt;Disclaimer&lt;/h2&gt;Sol, Fable and Astra were used heavily during development. For an outline of how I use AI to make mods, see &lt;a href="https://gamebanana.com/posts/13964739"&gt;https://gamebanana.com/posts/13964739&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;Donations&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;If you enjoy my work, feel free to &lt;a href="https://buymeacoffee.com/hansoloblaster" target="_blank"&gt;buy me a coffee&lt;/a&gt;! I provide the mod and its source code completely free and open source. I stand by that; so only donate if you're feeling friendly or would like to boost my spirits!</description>
