      <title>Self Recall</title>
      <author>HanSoloBlaster</author>
      <link>https://gamebanana.com/mods/715735</link>
      <comments>https://gamebanana.com/mods/715735#PostsListModule</comments>
      <guid isPermaLink="false">cb6b7ac5ec9d77eb1c926d170a23c0cb09ccb855</guid>
      <pubDate>Wed, 11 Nov 2026 15:44:35 +0000</pubDate>
      <description>&lt;img src="https://images.gamebanana.com/img/ss/mods/6aa22e6e49e09.jpg"/&gt;&lt;img src="https://images.gamebanana.com/img/ss/mods/6aa22e6eadaf3.jpg"/&gt;&lt;img src="https://images.gamebanana.com/img/ss/mods/6aa22e6f1d02d.jpg"/&gt;&lt;img src="https://images.gamebanana.com/img/ss/mods/6aa22e7ddb07c.jpg"/&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Update:&lt;/strong&gt; Fieldworks/Patches&lt;br&gt;&lt;h2&gt;Self Recall&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;h3&gt;v1.1.3&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;ul&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;p&gt;Added to &lt;a target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer nofollow" href="https://gamebanana.com/mods/739060"&gt;Zonai Fieldworks&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;p&gt;Fixed a memory issue when using several of my mods together.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;h3&gt;v1.1.1&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;ul&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;p&gt;Fixed issues with custom paragliders specifically in Ryujinx.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;h3&gt;v1.1.0&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;ul&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;p&gt;Now supports every version of Tears of the Kingdom for both Switch and emulators: v1.0.0 - v1.4.3&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;h3&gt;v1.0.15&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;ul&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;p&gt;Added support for more detailed custom player models (like Wolf Link).&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;p&gt;Added support for custom paragliders.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;h3&gt;v1.0.14&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;ul&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;p&gt;Mod now works with UltraCam enabled at the same time.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;hr&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;h1&gt;Self Recall&lt;/h1&gt;&lt;h3&gt;Description&lt;/h3&gt;Self recall lets you rewind Link through his recent traversal history. An muted background effect is applied, a golden ribbon showing your historical trail shows and animations run in reverse. &lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;ZL+Right-Joystick-Click (hold 1 second) to activate.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;h2&gt;Speed&lt;/h2&gt;By default, self-recall will run in reverse at 1.25x speed. By wearing upgraded articles of clothing from the Glide set, you can increase the speed. &lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;ul&gt;&lt;li&gt;0 articles -&gt; 1.25x &lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;1 article -&gt; 1.5x&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;2 articles -&gt; 2x&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;3 articles -&gt; 4x&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;br&gt;Every fully upgraded version of the Glide Mask, Glide Shirt and Glide Tights counts.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;h2&gt;Known Issues&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;li&gt;Recalling through an Ascend works - but is almost always a glitchy experience. I decided to leave it in for the novelty factor.&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;On Switch, Link skips along his path at 4x speed and during fast movement at 2x.&#13;
The rest of the game stays smooth. Zero or one Glide piece gives the tested&#13;
smooth 1.25x/1.5x rates.&lt;/li&gt;&#13;
&lt;li&gt;Driving Recall can stutter mildly at the beginning on Switch.&lt;/li&gt;&#13;
&lt;li&gt;Recorded shirtless transitions can make Link's torso disappear.&lt;/li&gt;&#13;
&lt;li&gt;The camera can lose Link during fast vertical Recall or enter terrain around&#13;
climbing overhangs.&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;Historical pose markers along the ribbon are not included.&lt;/li&gt;4x/2x recall speed can be choppy. &lt;br&gt;Link's torso, head, legs or armor may disappear during a recall. &lt;br&gt;Equipment changes are no longer tracked. (necessary for memory savings).&lt;br&gt;Use of the phrenic bow or bows which aim in first person will cause everything but Link's head to temporarily disappear.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;h2&gt;Code and Detailed README&lt;/h2&gt;MIT Licensed source code and a &lt;b&gt;far more in-depth mod description available &lt;a href="https://github.com/afiaka87/totk-mods/tree/main/self-recall" target="_blank"&gt;here&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;h2&gt;Disclaimer&lt;/h2&gt;Relied heavily on astra for this. For an outline of how I use AI to make mods, see &lt;a href="https://gamebanana.com/posts/13964739"&gt;https://gamebanana.com/posts/13964739&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;Donations&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;If you enjoy my work, feel free to &lt;a href="https://buymeacoffee.com/hansoloblaster" target="_blank"&gt;buy me a coffee&lt;/a&gt;! I provide the mod and its source code completely free and open source. I stand by that; so only donate if you're feeling friendly or would like to boost my spirits!</description>
